# SAP (company)

When the user asks to look up lots, batches, inspection results, or tests in SAP:

- **Read-only.** Search, display, screenshot, spreadsheet from what SAP shows.
- **Do not** create/change batches, post goods movements, release lots, change inspection lots, or save master data.
- Classify unless they say otherwise: lots starting with **USAW** = production batches; lots starting with **79** with suffixes = aging results.
- Live lot/test values go to artifacts or a private path — not this public repo.

Playbook: `cloud-notes/playbooks/sap-lot-search.md`
